class_name SimMoodReplies
extends RefCounted
## Cursing Gnomes — mood-flavored Messenger replies (Jeremy 2026-10-04).
##
## 100+ standalone replies per mood, 747 total (2026-10-04 wake pass:
## happy 117, sad 105, angry 108, scared 109, proud 105, disgusted 101,
## neutral 102). Each line is generic
## enough to fit any conversation context (greetings, acknowledgments,
## small talk, reactions, sign-offs) but flavored by the NPC's current
## mood — the same "hello" lands very differently from a happy NPC
## than from a furious one. Faction personality shows through too:
## an angry ogre is not an angry elf.
##
## {name} and {ruler} tokens are substituted by SimConversation after
## the mood line is appended. No emoji glyphs anywhere (iPhone tofu
## rule — chat text must render on device).
##
## Usage: SimConversation._apply_mood_line() picks via pick(mood).


